---
import { BRAND } from '../lib/saas/plans';
const user = Astro.locals.user;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <title>{BRAND} — About</title>
    <meta name="description" content={`${BRAND} is built by Rudra Prasad Kasturi, a growth and SEO leader who ran organic search for Amazon India, Yahoo APAC/MENA and Snapdeal.`} />
    <style>
      :root { --pink: #6366f1; --pink-dark: #4f46e5; --ink: #1d1f2b; --muted: #6b6f80; --line: #e7e8ef; --bg: #f6f6fa; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body { margin: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background: #fff; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.65; }
      .wrap { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 22px; }
      header.top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 18px 0; max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 22px; padding-right: 22px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
      .logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink); }
      .logo .mark { width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(120deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6); color: #fff; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 14px; }
      .navlinks { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .navlinks a.plain { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
      .navlinks a.plain:hover { color: var(--ink); }
      a.btn { text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 18px; background: var(--pink); color: #fff; white-space: nowrap; }
      a.btn:hover { background: var(--pink-dark); }
      main { padding: 40px 0 60px; }
      h1 { font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 6px; }
      .role { color: var(--pink-dark); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14.5px; margin: 0 0 24px; }
      h2 { font-size: 18px; margin: 34px 0 12px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
      p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
      p b { color: var(--ink); }
      .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 14px; margin: 26px 0 30px; }
      @media (max-width: 640px) { .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
      .stat { background: var(--bg); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 12px; text-align: center; }
      .stat b { display: block; font-size: 20px; color: var(--pink-dark); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
      .stat span { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); }
      .companies { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.8; }
      .companies b { color: var(--ink); }
      .quote { border-left: 3px solid var(--pink); padding-left: 16px; font-style: italic; color: var(--ink); margin: 30px 0; }
      footer { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12.5px; padding: 30px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 30px; }
      footer a { color: var(--muted); }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="top">
      <a class="logo" href="/"><span class="mark">▲</span>{BRAND}</a>
      <div class="navlinks">
        <a class="plain" href="/about">About</a>
        <a class="btn" href={user ? '/rank' : '/signup'}>{user ? 'Open dashboard' : 'Start free trial'}</a>
      </div>
    </header>
    <main>
      <div class="wrap">
        <h1>About {BRAND}</h1>
        <p class="role">Built by Rudra Prasad Kasturi — Chief Strategy &amp; AI Growth Architect</p>

        <p>
          {BRAND} is built by <b>Rudra Prasad Kasturi</b>, who has spent <b>20+ years</b> running
          organic growth, SEO, and AI-led transformation for some of the internet's largest consumer
          platforms — the exact discipline this tool is built on.
        </p>

        <div class="stats">
          <div class="stat"><b>20+ yrs</b><span>Growth &amp; SEO leadership</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><b>USD 25M+</b><span>Cumulative value created</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><b>34</b><span>Digital units scaled at Times Group</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><b>100M+</b><span>Users grown at Sportskeeda</span></div>
        </div>

        <h2>Why this tool exists</h2>
        <p>
          Before "ASO" was a category, Rudra was already running organic search and discovery at
          scale: <b>SEO Head for Amazon.in and Junglee.com</b> (2012–2015), designing India's
          launch-to-purchase organic growth strategy and its first vernacular, trust-led acquisition
          framework; <b>Head of SEO &amp; Audience Growth for Yahoo! across APAC and MENA</b>
          (2007–2012), directing organic growth across 9 countries; and <b>Group SEO Head for
          Snapdeal</b> — overseeing organic visibility for Snapdeal, FreeCharge, Exclusively and Shopo.
        </p>
        <p>
          That's the same problem {BRAND} solves, just for app stores instead of the web: knowing
          exactly which keywords you rank for, where you stand against competitors, and what on your
          listing is costing you installs — without needing an enterprise growth team to find out.
        </p>

        <h2>The bigger picture</h2>
        <p>
          Rudra has since scaled growth at <b>Times Group</b> (Chief Growth Officer / AI Labs Head,
          2016–2024 — 34 digital business units, 10× user growth, ₹200 Cr/~USD 25M in added annual
          digital revenue), served as <b>Chief Strategy Officer at India Today Group</b>, led
          <b> global growth for Byju's</b> across 12 international markets, and currently advises
          <b> CRED</b> on AI-led growth and <b>Nykaa</b> on AI visibility and Answer Engine
          Optimization (AEO) — the same discipline behind {BRAND}'s Rank Tracker and ASO Inspector.
        </p>
        <p>
          He's also the founder of <b>AI Vidhyarthi</b>, India's first grassroots AI literacy
          initiative for Tier 2/3 students, and <b>RK Consulting Group</b>, an advisory practice
          helping startups and enterprises operationalize AI for growth.
        </p>

        <p class="companies">
          <b>Built for / advised:</b> Times Group · India Today · Amazon · Byju's · Yahoo! · Tencent ·
          CRED · Nykaa · Cars24 · Network18 · Sportskeeda · Snapdeal
        </p>

        <p class="quote">"AI teaches scale; soil teaches patience. Real growth needs both."</p>

        <h2>Why {BRAND}</h2>
        <p>
          Professional app store rank tracking and ASO auditing have historically been priced for
          large marketing teams — out of reach for indie developers and small studios who need the
          same visibility to grow. {BRAND} brings that same rigor into one focused, affordable tool:
          know exactly where your app ranks for the keywords that drive installs, and know whether
          your store listing is working for or against you.
        </p>
        <p>
          Questions, feedback, or a feature you'd like to see? Reach out any time — {BRAND} is
          actively built based on what real app owners need.
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>
    <footer>
      <div class="wrap">© {new Date().getFullYear()} {BRAND} · Built by Rudra Prasad Kasturi · <a href="/">Home</a></div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
